   "text": "14. After the preparation of the Ashtakavarga of any planet, it should be seen ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    57,
    556,
    73
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "which house contains the highest number of bindus and what house it is from the ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    82,
    556,
    97
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "house occupied by the karaka planet which is to be treated as the Lagna or the first ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    106,
    556,
    121
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "house. When a planet — malefic or benefic in the course of his transit passes ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    130,
    556,
    145
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "through that house, he enchances its good effects. The reverse will be the case ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    154,
    556,
    169
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "when the planet in the course of his transit passes through a house containing few ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    178,
    556,
    194
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "or no benefic bindus.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    202,
    203,
    218
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "15. When a number of planets in course of their transits pass through a ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    226,
    556,
    242
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "house containing a good number of benefic bindus in the Ashtakavarga of a planet, ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    251,
    556,
    266
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "they produce substantially good results of the house, the countig being reckoned ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    275,
    556,
    290
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "from the house occupied by the karaka planet whose Ashtakavarga is under ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    299,
    556,
    314
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "consideration. The previous verse gives the time of position of benefic bindus in a ",
