  {
   "text": "Saturn remains In a sign for 2 1/2 years. When will he produce his good or ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    584,
    556,
    600
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "bad effects. One way to find out this has been given in verse.",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    609,
    426,
    624
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "16-19. To ascertain the same draw a table of 96 squares and suppose we ",
   "bbox": [
    121,
    633,
    556,
    648
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "have to find out the effects of Saturn's transit, prepare a table for Saturn as given ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    657,
    556,
    672
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "above. It has been stated that in preparing Saturn's Ashtakavarga benefic bindus ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    681,
    556,
    697
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "will fall in 1-2-4-7-10-11 house from the Sun. The Sun is in Scorpio, so from ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    705,
    556,
    721
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Scorpio the 1-2-4-7-10-11 houses will fall in Sagittarius, Aquarius, Taurus, ",
   "bbox": [
    85,
    729,
    556,
    745
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Gemini, Leo and Virgo. Put benefic bindus in these places. Similar benefic bindus ",
   "bbox": [
